ransform] duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.7,0.25,1)] md:hidden pointer-events-none -translate-y-2 opacity-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-3.5\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 \"><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"shrink-0\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fluma-orb.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fluma-orb.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fluma-orb.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"text-[1.15rem] font-semibold lowercase tracking-tight text-warm-text\">luma</span></span><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close menu\" class=\"text-warm-text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col justify-center gap-1 pb-16\"><a class=\"font-display text-[2rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-warm-text\" style=\"transition:opacity 300ms ease, transform 300ms ease;transform:translateY(8px);opacity:0\" href=\"/en#how-it-works\">How it works</a><a class=\"font-display text-[2rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-warm-text\" style=\"transition:opacity 300ms ease, transform 300ms ease;transform:translateY(8px);opacity:0\" href=\"/en#voices\">Voices</a><a class=\"font-display text-[2rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-warm-text\" style=\"transition:opacity 300ms ease, transform 300ms ease;transform:translateY(8px);opacity:0\" href=\"/en/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"font-display text-[2rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-warm-text\" style=\"transition:opacity 300ms ease, transform 300ms ease;transform:translateY(8px);opacity:0\" href=\"/en/faq\">FAQ</a><a class=\"mt-8 inline-flex w-fit rounded-full bg-warm-text px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-warm-bg\" style=\"opacity:0;transition:opacity 300ms\" href=\"/en#download\">Get the app</a></div></div></header><main class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col\"><section class=\"px-6 py-24 md:py-32  \"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl text-center\"><p class=\"mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-warm-accent\">Legal</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-warm-text md:text-[2.6rem]\">Terms of Service</h2></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"mb-8 text-sm text-warm-textMuted\">Last updated: <!-- -->June 5, 2026</p><p class=\"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-warm-textMuted\">These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your use of <!-- -->Luma<!-- -->. By creating an account or using the app, you agree to these Terms. Please read them carefully.</p><h2 class=\"mt-10 mb-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-warm-text md:text-2xl\">What <!-- -->Luma<!-- --> is, and is not</h2><p class=\"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-warm-textMuted\">Luma<!-- --> is a voice-first AI companion for emotional support and reflection. It is not therapy. It is not a medical or psychological service. It is not a substitute for a licensed clinician, and it cannot diagnose, treat, or prevent any condition. If you are in crisis, please contact your local emergency number.</p><h2 class=\"mt-10 mb-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-warm-text md:text-2xl\">Age requirement</h2><p class=\"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-warm-textMuted\">You must be at least <!-- -->16<!-- --> years old to use <!-- -->Luma<!-- -->. By signing up you confirm you are <!-- -->16<!-- --> or older. We will delete the account of any user we discover to be under <!-- -->16<!-- -->.</p><h2 class=\"mt-10 mb-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-warm-text md:text-2xl\">Your account</h2><p class=\"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-warm-textMuted\">You sign in with a one-time code sent to your email. Keep access to that inbox secure,           anyone who can read your email can sign in as you. You are responsible for any activity on your account. You can sign out from Settings.</p><h2 class=\"mt-10 mb-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-warm-text md:text-2xl\">Subscription, free tier, and renewals</h2><p class=\"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-warm-textMuted\">The free tier includes unlimited text conversation and a daily voice allowance that resets at local midnight. Premium plans (weekly, monthly, yearly) unlock unlimited voice and additional voices. Subscriptions are billed by Apple (App Store) or Google (Play Store) at the price shown at checkout in your local currency. They renew automatically at the end of each period unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the renewal date. Manage or cancel from your Apple ID or Google Play account.</p><h2 class=\"mt-10 mb-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-warm-text md:text-2xl\">Refunds</h2><p class=\"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-warm-textMuted\">Refunds are handled by Apple and Google according to their respective policies, we do not process refunds directly. To request a refund, visit reportaproblem.apple.com (iOS) or play.google.com/store/account (Android).</p><h2 class=\"mt-10 mb-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-warm-text md:text-2xl\">Acceptable use</h2><p class=\"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-warm-textMuted\">Luma<!-- --> is a tool for personal reflection and support. Do not use it to attempt to extract harmful, illegal, or sexually explicit content. Do not use it to impersonate others, abuse the safety classifier, or attempt to access accounts that are not yours. We may suspend accounts that violate these Terms.</p><h2 class=\"mt-10 mb-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-warm-text md:text-2xl\">Disclaimers and limitation of liability</h2><p class=\"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-warm-textMuted\">Luma<!-- --> is provided as-is, without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee uninterrupted availability, voice and AI services depend on third-party providers and the public internet. To the maximum extent permitted by law, <!-- -->Luma<!-- --> and its operators are not liable for indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages, or for any loss of data, revenue, or profit arising out of your use of <!-- -->Luma<!-- -->. Nothing in these Terms limits liability for fraud, gross negligence, or for harms that cannot be excluded under your local consumer law.</p><h2 class=\"mt-10 mb-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-warm-text md:text-2xl\">Changes</h2><p class=\"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-warm-textMuted\">We may update these Terms. Material changes will be flagged in-app before they take effect. Continued use after a change means you accept it.</p><h2 class=\"mt-10 mb-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-warm-text md:text-2xl\">Contact</h2><p class=\"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-warm-textMuted\">Questions about these Terms? Contact us at<!-- --> <a class=\"text-warm-accent underline\" href=\"mailto:support@heyluma.app\">support@heyluma.app</a>.</p></div></div></section><!--$?--><template id=\"B:1\"></template><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"relative mt-auto overflow-hidden border-t border-warm-border bg-warm-surface/60 px-6 pb-10 pt-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-12 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between\"><div class=\"max-w-sm\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 \"><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"shrink-0\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fluma-orb.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fluma-orb.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fluma-orb.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"text-[1.15rem] font-semibold lowercase tracking-tight text-warm-text\">luma</span></span><p class=\"mt-4 text-warm-textMuted\">Not therapy. Just a friend.</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-warm-textMu